    "text": "14 hours ago LOCK HAVEN, Pa. (EYT) — The Pennsylvania State Athletic Conference announced their weekly men’s basketball award winners on Monday. Clarion’s Jeremy Thomas II was named the PSAC West Defensive Athlete of the Week for Nov. 24. Thomas recorded the only triple-double in NCAA Division II to date... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
